動漫節2024 Cosplay Day4 相集（鍾世傑 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240730/894778013416296448018795.jpeg/dKCEg8pO5WKXHAQJfJXk6Oe5khUFpN5Kjnysvo58rL4\"/><figcaption>動漫節2024 Cosplay Day4 相集（鍾世傑 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"動漫節2024 Cosplay Day4 相集（鍾世傑 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240730/894778018135019520368174.jpeg/sQpybGoaZ5ID0sGO11TIm0qL0CN7krLjU_JBlFPyQZQ\"/><figcaption>動漫節2024 Cosplay Day4 相集（鍾世傑 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"動漫節2024 Cosplay Day4 相集（鍾世傑 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240730/894778022522392576162309.jpeg/CbdEoYd3B6x4DkRWYJEybRYb4H9XhWS64Z14WOGdeFg\"/><figcaption>動漫節2024 Cosplay Day4 相集（鍾世傑 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"動漫節2024 Cosplay Day4 相集（鍾世傑 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240730/894778027522134016904376.jpeg/b8Orjph4sO47CjAmO3V03PbwrGDjeHOfu2VQobtlUKE\"/><figcaption>動漫節2024 Cosplay Day4 相集（鍾世傑 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"攝影：陳葦慈\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240726/893602964596461568951276.jpeg/svlLzfaFXmcJsUNMNS29iVqjDZ4IgcSwSzdNZXE3TWU\"/><figcaption>攝影：陳葦慈</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"攝影：陳葦慈\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240726/893602969860444160847096.jpeg/0SlODmTGJ6d5Fwo6uHyUoTr4Gu-QWxrwjs1oSrTNaEo\"/><figcaption>攝影：陳葦慈</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"攝影：陳葦慈\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240726/893602973719334912185923.jpeg/IGjnRe3C_LWZiGg9WMAUww63ONCoV1WtU0Ohr2lDoa8\"/><figcaption>攝影：陳葦慈</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"攝影：陳葦慈\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240726/893602976953274368769853.jpeg/n21gG0QRSUCr-VwTx7LC1OYuErnUt_HhvaHiooeh4qI\"/><figcaption>攝影：陳葦慈</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"攝影：陳葦慈\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240726/893602959990984704802497.jpeg/ktVEUldwXO9qwff7kUIUw2rf1JyDxA9EhAzlFL4M5RQ\"/><figcaption>攝影：陳葦慈</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"攝影：陳葦慈\"